     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Breaking Down Massachusetts’ Daily Purchase Limits for Recreational Cannabis (UPDATED 4/2026)"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Massachusetts has a well-defined legal framework for recreational cannabis purchases to ensure consumer safety, responsible usage, and regulatory compliance. The daily legal limit is <strong>56</strong><b> grams (2 ounces) of flower</b>, but this can be distributed across various cannabis products. <strong>Here’s how the daily limit translates into practical terms and grams (g) for different product types.</strong></p>"
    }
   ]
